<title>SINGAPORE: Asia Gas Oil/Jet - Singapore markets closed.</title>
<headline>Asia Gas Oil/Jet - Singapore markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-03-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Singapore physical oil products market is closed on Friday for the Good Friday holiday. The market will reopen on Monday, March 31.</p>
<p>This is how the cash gas oil and jet market ended on Thursday:</p>
<p>(Prices in dollars per barrel)</p>
<p> MTH FOB SIN		     BUY/SELL     PREV BUY/SELL</p>
<p> APR JET KEROSENE/KERO     25.30/25.60	 26.00/26.30</p>
<p> APR GAS OIL 0.5% S	  26.50/27.30	 27.20/28.50</p>
<p> APR JET/GAS OIL SWAPS     -0.35/-0.20	 -0.20/0.00</p>
<p> APR GAS OIL SWAPS	   25.85/26.00	 26.25/26.35</p>
<p> MAY GAS OIL SWAPS	   24.90/25.05	 25.25/25.30</p>
